  ⚠ unicorn(prefer-ternary): Prefer ternary expressions over simple `if-else` statements.
   ╭─[prefer_ternary.tsx:1:1]
 1 │ if (x) {o["\uD800"] = 1;} else {o["\ud800"] = 2;}
